breakdown|Three contexts distinguish machine failure, failed communication and itemized costs; no emotional-diagnosis Sense. Each Vietnamese example retains its event and participants.
behaviour|Animal behaviour example is neutral; uncountable noun and UK spelling noted. The translation renders observed reactions without adding a motive.
captive|Noun prisoner scope matches the evidence; no lawful-detention inference. The transfer event and guards remain in Vietnamese.
contingent|A representative subgroup is supported; adjective contingency not drafted. Parade example demonstrates membership, not uncertainty.
deprive|Object plus of-complement explicitly reviewed; village/water deprivation stays causally tied to the power cut.
cave|Natural hollow in rock excludes buildings; bats are context, not a required feature. Vietnamese keeps the location near the entrance.
dwell|Live-in-place source supports a literary verb; dwell on is not included. Formal register and intransitive preposition are disclosed.
both|Shared two-member meaning has two grammatical proposals; possible coalescence is pending. Plural noun versus standalone pronoun checked in the paired examples.
disease|Definition avoids equating all disease with infection. Some diseases in the example is faithfully limited in Vietnamese; specialist verification remains pending.
bail|Release and security-money uses are related but contextually distinct. Financial conditions are not universal; US court evidence checks the concept, not global legal uniformity.
combine|Transitive object and joined result match; objects remain tables in both languages. Other valencies are usage notes, not automatic new Senses.
clearly|Understandable manner is demonstrated by explain, not inferred obviousness. The command and recipients remain in translation.
capitalist|Adjective system and noun investor require POS review. Neutral economy description and investor example avoid implying every supporter owns capital.
charm|Place appeal and believed lucky object have distinct references. Belief is attributed, not claimed true; the unsupported verb is left for later evidence review.
drink|Noun beverage versus verb swallowing distinguished. Water example is not alcohol use; irregular forms and transitivity checked.
closet|Cupboard/storage room boundary combined provisionally. Blankets preserve a real storage use; figurative closeted identity not inferred.
creature|Unnamed living being is supported. Wet-leaf example and Vietnamese sinh vật correspond; Master overlap is no identity proof.
deviate|Deviate from checked; a route can diverge spatially. Proper course in source does not require an ethical judgment in the draft.
can|Ability, permission and container distinguished. Modal morphology and bare infinitive reviewed; permission example is not mistaken for ability.
desk|Work/study table has a concrete location example. History linkage remains an identity blocker, not reuse permission.
furthermore|Linking adverb adds a supporting fact; semicolon connects independent clauses. Vietnamese hơn nữa preserves addition.
exceptional|Outstanding versus unusual distinguished; unusual circumstances are not automatically beneficial. Memory example demonstrates outstanding quality.
editor|Human publication role limited deliberately; software-editor Sense needs other evidence. Paragraph revision has matching participants.
full|Container capacity and satiation are separately contextualized. Full of and predicative full constructions checked; translations preserve the contrast.
finger|Hand-part meaning retained without resolving thumb conventions. Pointing with one finger supplies the physical use.
grade|School mark, quality rank, school year and grading action reviewed as distinct proposals. Fourth grade remains source-context school year, not a Vietnamese curriculum classification.
entrance|Physical opening, not admission fee or dramatic arrival. Behind the tree remains a location and does not shift the noun meaning.
entirely|Complete scope is expressed by entirely yours; Vietnamese retains ownership of the decision. No partial hedge introduced.
embassy|Institution/building uses coalesced provisionally. Waiting outside illustrates the physical office; no consular-service promise or immigration advice.
goodbye|Expression and nominal parting-use distinguished for representation review. Interjection mapping is a schema-compatible proposal; same core meaning may coalesce.
fully|Degree modifier of understand reviewed; two students and instructions retained. Completeness is narrative, not a claimed external validation.
figure|Number data, role-person, body outline and calculated amount reviewed separately. Source understand/figure out group remains unrepresented, not erased or silently merged.
effectively|Successful action differs from in-practice isolation. The closed bridge and practical consequence remain coupled in Vietnamese.
even|Unexpected inclusion, number parity and flat surface distinguished. Zero/negative whole numbers are not excluded; youngest-child focus retained.
fat|Food/body substance and animal-body adjective distinguished. Label example is descriptive; animal context avoids pejorative person labeling.
fluid|Liquid and gas coalesced in one inclusive physical definition. Changing-timetable adjective is abstract; source POS/meaning ambiguity remains pending.
exact|Precision without approximation is demonstrated by the clock instruction. No automatic Master identity or Sense CEFR from lemma matching.
happy|Joy/satisfaction coalesced, willingness separate. Happy with and happy to constructions align with their Vietnamese pairs.
far|Distance adverb and attributive far end distinguished. Negative did not walk far remains negative in Vietnamese.
go|Travel/leaving coalesced; an activity attempt is separate. Irregular morphology and go to versus a go at checked.
inner|Physical inside position, not private thoughts. Inner pocket and zipper preserve the exact relation.
idiom|Established nonliteral expression distinguished from any multiword string. Break the ice example includes a Vietnamese explanation without claiming a source lexical mapping.
monkey|Primate description excludes apes and avoids universal tail claims. Fruit-reaching is neutral; species boundary still warrants specialist review.
kind|Consideration adjective versus type noun distinguished. Kind of you differs from what kind of paper, with matching Vietnamese constructions.
intriguing|Stimulus adjective, not a person's intrigued state. Hidden-note example creates curiosity; translation preserves an appealing mystery.
importance|Uncountable significance noun; importance of keeping the path clear checked. Vietnamese retains the action as its complement.
industry|Sector can include services, not only factories. Fishing example matches the economic sense; diligence not invented.
managerial|Management-related adjective supported. Skills example does not impose an executive rank or job classification.
implicate|Evidence suggests involvement, not proven guilt. Revised definition and Vietnamese example retain uncertainty; legal reasoning not offered.
mandarin|Capitalized language display proposed without merging the source key. Mandarin varieties and Standard Chinese relationship checked; source two-language simplification not reused.
lodge|Rural/mountain accommodation noun only. Overnight walking-group context does not require every lodge to serve hunters exclusively.
low|Scalar adjective, manner/position adverb and a minimum-level nominal use distinguished. Source enum mappings and possible usage coalescence remain pending.
leg|Body limb and furniture support are separately demonstrated. Same metaphorical relationship does not justify canonical identity reuse.
listen|Listen to complement mandatory in example; deliberate attention not mere hearing. Vietnamese command targets the same announcement.
mayor|Municipal official description accommodates jurisdiction variation. Town-hall welcome is descriptive and not evidence of appointment method.
martial art|Countable discipline, not an instruction in combat. Judo example illustrates membership; singular/plural convention disclosed.
immune system|Network of cells/tissues/organs checked against NIH overview; no single-organ or guaranteed-cure claim. Diagram example contains no medical guidance.
mirror|Reflective object only; scarf checking is natural and faithfully paired. No figurative verb or history reassignment.
ice cream|Frozen dessert allows varying ingredients; not an absolute dairy rule. Shared mango serving is unchanged in translation.
junk food|Draft corrected away from equating every quick snack with junk food. Nutrient-based usual pattern is descriptive; personalized diet advice absent.
repair|Fixing damage action and repair work noun distinguished. Handle/screw and roof-before-rainy-season examples preserve their separate references.
reduce|Make-less meaning with electricity-use object reviewed. By/to distinction is usage guidance, not an unsupported new classification.
precede|Direct object, order before, no to-complement. Welcome speech before concert matches Vietnamese timing.
restaurant|Meal business not restricted to waiter service. Lunch deadline retained; no imported cuisine taxonomy.
pier|Projects from shore over water, does not require a second-bank span. Boat-viewing example supports recreational use without making it exclusive.
resident|Person noun and residential adjective share core living-place meaning. Local/longer-term residence is not a legal immigration status determination.
plenty|Sufficient amount expressed in plenty of chairs; nominal/pronoun convention unresolved. Enough chairs for guests, not an invented precise count.
peer|Age/status noun groups combined provisionally; careful-looking verb separate. Through gap is intransitive and distinct from peers as classmates.
nature|Natural world and essential character distinguished. River study versus nature of trust provide corresponding contextual cues. Initial problem example matched source wording; paired example revised and full-source stratum rechecked.
neither|Two-member exclusion determiner/pronoun versus negative addition reviewed. Inversion neither can checked; neither of agreement convention remains pending.
overnight|Literal duration and figurative sudden fame distinguished. Almost qualifier preserved; metaphor is not translated as a verified one-night duration.
no one|Indefinite two-word pronoun and singular agreement checked. No one knew translates to không ai biết, without loss of negation.
patch|Repair material, software update and localized area distinguished. Each paired example demonstrates its intended domain without taxonomy allocation.
premium|Insurance payment and extra-price noun senses distinguished. Revised seat example excludes default adjective assumptions; no financial recommendation.
quiet|Little noise and little speech separately contextualized. Smiling does not disprove quiet behaviour or imply a diagnosis.
physician|Qualified medical-doctor noun; regional surgeon contrast noted. Educational talk example is not diagnosis or treatment.
read|Comprehension of writing with silent/aloud use combined. Irregular pronunciation noted without audio output; instructions translated faithfully.
per cent|Per-hundred numerical expression reviewed; source NOUN/ADJECTIVE/ADVERB assignments not auto-approved. OTHER fallback leaves numeral/lexical-unit policy explicit.
pipe dream|Unrealistic hope idiom, not literal pipe. Funding condition and still-unrealized garden remain paired; no prediction of absolute impossibility.
next to|Spatial beside preposition only. Bicycle/gate example demonstrates proximity; nearly construction not invented.
sponsorship|Support beyond money allowed; shops/concert context concrete. Publicity is possible but not made universal.
sympathy|Care for suffering, not automatic agreement. Pet loss and neighbours remain in Vietnamese without medical claims.
skiing|Snow-skis activity excludes water-skiing in this proposal. Gentle slope is narrative context, not a safety recommendation.
susceptible|Susceptible to complement; material fading avoids medical prognosis. Thin curtains and sunlight remain in both languages.
utter|Transitive saying verb, not adjective complete. Did not utter a word preserves negation in the paired translation.
scan|Digital capture versus targeted quick reading distinguished. Signed form and brother's name separate the meanings; no template substitution.
sick|General illness versus nausea distinguished and regional context stated. Winding-road example shows nausea, not a diagnosed disease.
stand|Upright verb, support noun and tolerate verb distinguished. Cannot stand is a negative tolerance construction; object fan noise preserved.
solemn|Serious manner need not imply honesty. Ceremony example matches; source honesty overstatement is not reused.
station|Railway facility and broadcasting institution distinguished. Arrival versus interview demonstrate different referents.
shareholder|Individual/organization holding shares supported; no automatic manager status. Company report example does not offer investment advice.
terminal|Transport building, end-stage illness and computer device distinguished. Medical wording remains expected prognosis, not guaranteed timing; specialist review pending.
successfully|Intended outcome, not perfection. Piano/upstairs participants and result retained.
subject|Topic, condition-sensitive adjective, school discipline and grammatical subject reviewed. Passive clauses show why subject cannot always mean doer; verb source evidence remains unrepresented.
straight|Direction adverb versus shape adjective distinguished. Flat-adverb construction in walk straight is retained as valid; no identity-related colloquial meaning introduced.
teacher|Education profession noun; paper-folding example demonstrates instruction. History linkage remains preserved and unresolved.
thereby|Result-linking adverb with participial clause checked. Labeling boxes makes unpacking easier; source CONJUNCTION conflict left pending.
small|Physical size versus low amount/chance proposals. Scale separation is tentative and requires boundary review; example translations retain dimensions.
substantially|Degree adverb of reduction, not an adjective despite source conflict. Considerable change does not impose a numerical threshold.
visible (adj)|Annotation removal is a display proposal only; candidate key stays exact. Can-be-seen definition and viewpoint example checked; false multiword source flag disclosed.
whole|Complete adjective and nominal complete-unit use distinguished provisionally. Entire afternoon versus book-as-unit context retained.
which|Limited-choice interrogative determiner/pronoun usages reviewed. Relative uses not mechanically drafted from the two source groups.
weapon|Designed-or-used harm instrument avoids limiting to firearms. Museum example is descriptive; no weapon-use instruction.
worsen|Intransitive become-worse example matches source. Transitive valency noted conditionally, no forced new Sense or wrong object in example.
worthy|Deserving evaluative adjective, not objective approval. Worthy of pattern checked; volunteer example contextual.
washing|Laundry objects versus washing activity reviewed. Clothes hanging differs from time spent washing curtains; representation may coalesce.
wrap|Wrap object in material checked; towel protects a cup. Alternative around construction noted without extra Sense allocation.
week|Seven-day period coalesces source periodic construction. In a week remains a duration; no arbitrary first-day convention.
worse|Comparative adjective, adverb and nominal worse distinct by syntax. Played worse is comparative badly; nominal form still representation pending.
zone|Purpose/rule/feature-defined area supported. Pedestrian zone example matches without creating a canonical topic or location.
whereas|Contrast of two clauses, not a time adverb. Sunny versus cool remains faithful, no invented cause.
wound|Physical injury noun/verb and emotional-hurt verb reviewed. Distinct pronunciation from wind noted; nurse example provides no treatment directions.
wear|Having clothing on, not putting it on. Scarf example and wore morphology checked; Vietnamese quàng keeps the worn state in context.
whisper|Soft-speech action and utterance/voice noun proposals. Nearby audibility and rain context natural; no claim all whispers are secrets.
wild|Animal untamed and plant uncultivated proposals may coalesce. Rabbits/flowers contexts match; wild does not automatically mean aggressive.
wrong|Incorrect adjective, flat adverb, moral act and fault-state adjective reviewed. Spelled wrong remains valid adverb; wrong with construction checked.
worker|Job/work person not limited to factories. Carrying shelves is plausible; employment status not inferred.
worst|Superlative adjective/adverb and nominal possibility reviewed. Three-team comparison checked; the is not forced before performed worst.
written|Writing-versus-speech adjective, not merely any past-tense verb. Parcel instructions context matches; participial relation pending.
warming (n)|Annotation removed only in proposed display. Temperature-rise nominal includes causative/inchoative variation; no automatic global-climate topic or history merge.
